    "text": "Begin WhyWalkRiderPin\r\n\r\nfloat px\r\nfloat py\r\nfloat pz\r\nfloat pa\r\n\r\nif ( whywalk_active == 0 )\r\n    return\r\nendif\r\n\r\nset px to whywalk_x\r\nset py to whywalk_y\r\nset pz to whywalk_z\r\nplayer->SetPos X px\r\nplayer->SetPos Y py\r\nplayer->SetPos Z pz\r\n\r\nif ( whywalk_yawdelta != 0 )\r\n    set pa to ( player->GetAngle Z + whywalk_yawdelta )\r\n    player->SetAngle Z pa\r\n    set whywalk_yawdelta to 0\r\nendif\r\n\r\nEnd WhyWalkRiderPin"
